                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Nice little word game. Bright colors, bird sounds for relaxation, several game modes once you get through the tutorial. It's simple, in that you move letters to make words, but , it can also be quite complex, since when you move a letter , other letters move as well, so a person can go at this game either way: relaxing or strategic. I never tried to do anything complicated, but had fun surprises when I went to make a word and made three instead, occasionally. \"I totally meant to do that.\" \n\nIf I have one complaint, it's one that could be easily fixed by the dev: There were several words--English, obviously--that I made that the game did not recognize. So, its English dictionary could  be plumped up a bit.\n\nI only played for a few minutes, to get the gist of it, but I imagine I will be coming back to it -- for the relaxing bit.",
